  "execution": "기존 로컬 CSS만 사용한 별도 headless Edge 렌더이다. 원본 JavaScript·CMS API·저장·취소 동작을 실행하지 않았다.",
  "verification": "PNG를 직접 열어 상태 정보 제목, 취소/저장, 선택 필드 전체, 비활성 초안/실패(재등록), 선택된 승인(사용)이 모두 온전하게 표시됨을 확인했다.",
  "preservedDomHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><link href=\"file:///D:/jaehyuk.myung/claude_demo/Demo_36_REA_test/design-specs/revision-item-modal-render/css/6f20adfa-tabler.min-8497cabbf265b335c86458729f06f306.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><link href=\"file:///D:/jaehyuk.myung/claude_demo/Demo_36_REA_test/design-specs/revision-item-modal-render/css/8f71cfdf-tabler-themes.min-24d2bc2b59bff15ff0c69f51c56fa9e3.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><link href=\"file:///D:/jaehyuk.myung/claude_demo/Demo_36_REA_test/design-specs/revision-item-modal-render/css/be63e6ff-tabler-icons.min-cb7928bd18ff36b63a6778f3bbfa4e41.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><link href=\"file:///D:/jaehyuk.myung/claude_demo/Demo_36_REA_test/design-specs/revision-item-modal-render/css/c005bb55-custom-4f213f104c14367e2495ee02d06e6fb6.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><style>html,body{margin:0!important;background:#fff!important;width:1512px!important}body{pointer-events:none!important}.card{margin:0!important}</style></head><body><div class=\"card mt-3\">\n<div class=\"card-header bg-secondary-lt d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between\">\n<h3 class=\"card-title mb-0\"><i class=\"ti ti-adjustments me-1\"></i>상태 정보</h3>\n<div class=\"btn-list\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm d-none\" data-status-edit=\"\" type=\"button\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-edit me-1\"></i>수정\n                </button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-sm\" data-status-cancel=\"\" type=\"button\">취소</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" data-status-save=\"\" type=\"button\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-device-floppy me-1\"></i>저장\n                </button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<form class=\"card-body\" id=\"statusForm\">\n<input name=\"itemId\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"2088663\"/>\n<fieldset id=\"statusFields\">\n<div class=\"row g-2\">\n<div class=\"col-md-2\">\n<label class=\"form-label\">On-line 전용</label>\n<select class=\"form-select\" name=\"onlineFlag\">\n<option selected=\"selected\" value=\"N\">온오프 전체</option>\n<option value=\"Y\">온라인 전용</option>\n</select>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-2\">\n<label class=\"form-label\">용도</label>\n<select class=\"form-select\" name=\"serviceUsage\">\n<option value=\"C\">공통</option>\n<option value=\"T\">교사용</option>\n</select>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n<label class=\"form-label\">상태값</label>\n<div class=\"form-selectgroup w-100\">\n<label class=\"form-selectgroup-item flex-fill mb-0\">\n<input class=\"form-selectgroup-input\" disabled=\"disabled\" name=\"viewFlag\" type=\"radio\" value=\"R\"/>\n<span class=\"form-selectgroup-label\">초안</span>\n</label><label class=\"form-selectgroup-item flex-fill mb-0\">\n<input class=\"form-selectgroup-input\" disabled=\"disabled\" name=\"viewFlag\" type=\"radio\" value=\"F\"/>\n<span class=\"form-selectgroup-label\">실패(재등록)</span>\n</label><label class=\"form-selectgroup-item flex-fill mb-0\">\n<input checked=\"checked\" class=\"form-selectgroup-input\" name=\"viewFlag\" type=\"radio\" value=\"Y\"/>\n<span class=\"form-selectgroup-label\">승인(사용)</span>\n</label><label class=\"form-selectgroup-item flex-fill mb-0\">\n<input class=\"form-selectgroup-input\" name=\"viewFlag\" type=\"radio\" value=\"N\"/>\n<span class=\"form-selectgroup-label\">승인(미사용)</span>\n</label><label class=\"form-selectgroup-item flex-fill mb-0\">\n<input class=\"form-selectgroup-input\" name=\"viewFlag\" type=\"radio\" value=\"D\"/>\n<span class=\"form-selectgroup-label\">폐기</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n</form>\n</div></body></html>"
